OL,3,GNEWSAReality TV star backs extending   
OL,4,Asex education to 18                    
OL,6,FTV celebrity and "revenge porn" victim 
OL,7,FGeorgia Harrison has urged MPs to back 
OL,8,Fa new law that would extend compulsory 
OL,9,Frelationships and sex education (RSE)  
OL,10,Fup to the age of 18.                   
OL,12,FThe Only Way Is Essex and Love Island  
OL,13,Fstar led a protest outside Parliament  
OL,14,Fto call for the change, telling the BBC
OL,15,Fit was needed to combat the "poison"   
OL,16,Fyoung people were being exposed to     
OL,17,Fonline.                                
