OL,3,GNEWSAReality TV star backs extending   
OL,4,Asex education to 18                    
OL,6,FThe demonstration comes ahead of a     
OL,7,Fdebate and vote next week on a draft   
OL,8,Flaw that would legally require all     
OL,9,Ffurther education providers in England 
OL,10,Fto teach RSE to under-18s.             
OL,12,FThe Department for Education (DfE) said
OL,13,Fit was exploring how RSE could be      
OL,14,Fextended to colleges.                  
